{"title":"All Products","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Perfect Tree in Our All Trees Collection\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt King of Christmas, we understand that choosing the perfect Christmas tree is a cherished part of the holiday season. Our \"All Artificial Christmas Trees\" collection brings together our entire range of trees, offering something for every style, space, and budget. Whether you're looking for a towering centerpiece for your living room, a petite tree for a cozy corner, or something in between, our diverse selection ensures you'll find exactly what you're looking for.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Tree for Every Home and Style\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur collection includes a wide variety of tree types, from traditional green trees to flocked and colored options. Whether you prefer the classic look of a traditional fir, the wintery charm of a flocked tree, or the convenience of a pre-lit model, we have a tree that will perfectly match your holiday décor. Each tree is crafted from high-quality, fire-resistant materials, ensuring it remains a beautiful part of your holiday traditions for years to come.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasy Setup and Storage Solutions\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll of our artificial Christmas trees are designed with convenience in mind. With features like hinged branches and sturdy stands, setting up your tree is quick and easy. When the holiday season is over, simply disassemble your tree and store it in a cool, dry place. Our durable storage options help ensure your tree stays in great condition year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake Your Holidays Magical with King of Christmas\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the right Christmas tree is essential to creating the perfect holiday atmosphere, and with our extensive collection, you’re sure to find a tree that meets your needs. Explore our full range of artificial Christmas trees and bring the joy and beauty of the season into your home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-unlit","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642895167552,"sku":"PF-T8-U","price":219.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-11_5e399119-a4fe-4d26-8c77-bde58886c97f.jpg?v=1718158952"},{"product_id":"6-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"6' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 350 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642895921216,"sku":"PF-T6-L","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fbb2edf4-c5c9-4ad1-b201-ca0c1c1c4b0e.jpg?v=1714675465"},{"product_id":"7-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"7' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":41965569769672,"sku":"PF-T7-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fa622227-8cc4-441c-b46e-a6f7c09044bd.jpg?v=1714675463"},{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 550 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896379968,"sku":"PF-T8-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d.jpg?v=1714675448"},{"product_id":"10-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"10' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896707648,"sku":"PF-T10-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbna